{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1268368490"}, "name":{"label":"Andrej Cupac"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-21T03:52:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"167"}, "id":{"label":"13658723940"}, "title":{"label":"Constant Design Changes"}, "content":{"label":"These constant major design changes happen way often then necessary. It affects UX a little.\n\nA couple days ago the app looked perfect. Using the Apple Liquid Glass slider at the bottom of the screen to switch between sections of the app was great. All the general items were easy to read like your streak, relapses, etc. Among many other things.\n\nNow the bottom selector just blends into the black background making it harder on the eyes and annoying to use. My times “relapsed” count has now decreased for some reason (I’ve heard a lot of people complain about this so it’s definitely not just me. Some people even said theirs completely reset to zero).\n\nIf you just reverse the app version to the previous version all would be good.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
